validation_guide_sample.json holds the sample values Apple publishes in its Attestation Object
Validation Guide (https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicecheck/attestation-object-validation-guide):
the example Team ID, bundle ID and server challenge, the key identifier, the attestation object and
the expected intermediate values. The guide's separate "public key SHA256 hash" value does not match
its own sample and is left out; the key identifier (SHA-256 of the certified point) is what the
verifier checks.
